WEBVTT

00:01:28.292 --> 00:01:31.754
And when I was in the taxi
on the way to the speech,

00:01:31.796 --> 00:01:34.215
I found this little note tucked inside:

00:01:35.716 --> 00:01:38.469
“Ms. Grice, thank you for coming on

00:01:38.511 --> 00:01:41.681
and putting a smile on our faces
with your sweet words.

00:01:41.722 --> 00:01:43.266
You have been so kind,

00:01:43.307 --> 00:01:46.727
and we are very lucky to have you
as a loyal Delta customer.

00:01:46.769 --> 00:01:48.062
Thank you.

00:01:48.104 --> 00:01:49.981
I know you are gluten-free

00:01:50.022 --> 00:01:52.275
so here are some almonds for the road!

00:01:52.275 --> 00:01:53.985
Thank you for your kindness!

00:01:54.026 --> 00:01:55.570
It goes a long way!

00:01:55.570 --> 00:01:57.989
Sarah, Delta flight attendant."

00:01:58.739 --> 00:02:02.160
Now reading this,
my heart gave a little jolt.